1
00:00:00,967 --> 00:00:03,570
First, select the “CTA Canvas”

2
00:00:03,570 --> 00:00:08,375
Select “Enable Accordion Block”

3
00:00:08,375 --> 00:00:15,582
Select the layers that you would like to show & hide under the trigger

4
00:00:16,916 --> 00:00:22,222
You can preview the outcome by clicking the trigger block

5
00:00:22,222 --> 00:00:28,995
You can add on the accordion layer up to 3 layers

6
00:00:28,995 --> 00:00:37,103
Simply repeat the steps in your layer 1 block

7
00:00:37,103 --> 00:00:43,543
Now your layer 1 can be trigger as “Accordion Toggle”
